sses: Calendly, Reclaim.ai and Motion, with plans checked November 22, 2026.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0;\"><a href=\"https://zoltai.org/blog/top-3-ai-scheduling-tools-for-small-businesses-in-2026?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=zoltai-weekly\" style=\"color: #22d3ee; text-decoration: none;\">Read the guide &rarr;</a></p>\n\n    <a href=\"https://zoltai.org/blog/top-3-ai-project-management-tools-for-small-businesses-in-2026?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=zoltai-weekly\"><img src=\"https://zoltai.org/images/blog/claude-3-5-sonnet-vs-gpt-4-turbo-complete-business-guide-2024.png\" alt=\"Top 3 AI Project Management Tools for Small Businesses in 2026\" width=\"536\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 536px; border-radius: 8px; border: 0; margin-bottom: 12px;\" /></a>\n    <h3 style=\"color: #ededed; font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><a href=\"https://zoltai.org/blog/top-3-ai-project-management-tools-for-small-businesses-in-2026?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=zoltai-weekly\" style=\"color: #a78bfa; text-decoration: none;\">Top 3 AI Project Management Tools for Small Businesses in 2026</a></h3>\n    <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 8px 0;\">Three project management tools with AI features for small businesses: Trello, Asana and Notion, with plans checked November 22, 2026.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px 0;\"><a href=\"https://zoltai.org/blog/top-3-ai-project-management-tools-for-small-businesses-in-2026?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=zoltai-weekly\" style=\"color: #22d3ee; text-decoration: none;\">Read the guide &rarr;</a></p>\n    \n    <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 24px 0;\">Plus 4 more guides this week: <a href=\"https://zoltai.org/blog?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=zoltai-weekly\" style=\"color: #22d3ee; text-decoration: none;\">browse the blog &rarr;</a></p>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: #111113; border: 1px solid #1e1e1e; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 8px 0 24px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #22d3ee; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Quick summary: Top 5 AI Tools for Small Business Owners in 2026</p>\n      <ul style=\"color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>ChatGPT for writing, planning, and everyday business questions.</li>\n        <li>Canva AI for professional marketing visuals in minutes.</li>\n        <li>Zapier for automating repetitive tasks between your apps.</li>\n        <li>Tidio AI for answering customer questions around the clock.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;\">See you next week,<br/>The Zoltai team</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #71717a; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 24px 0 0 0;\">Prices and features were checked when each guide was written. Vendors change them, so check the vendor's pricing page. Generated November 22, 2026.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #1e1e1e;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">\n      You are receiving this because you signed up at <a href=\"https://zoltai.org\" style=\"color: #a78bfa;\">zoltai.org</a>.<br/>\n      <a href=\"https://zoltai.org/unsubscribe?{{unsubq}}\" style=\"color: #666;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"color: #444; font-size: 11px; margin: 8px 0 0 0;\">&copy; 2026 Zoltai &middot; zoltai.org</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
